### 1. Логин USER (запрос в JetBrains HTTP Client или VS Code REST Client)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"traveler","password":"Traveler123!"}

### 2. Логин ADMIN
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"operator","password":"Operator123!"}

### Далее укажите токен, полученный выше:
@token = REPLACE_WITH_BEARER_TOKEN

### 3. Доступные комнаты
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/recommend?startDate=2027-04-12&endDate=2027-04-15
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Новая бронь (новый requestId на каждую новую бронь)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo-booking-1

{"requestId":"c9b7b2f4-4f1a-4249-9e19-8b203c242df4","autoSelect":true,"startDate":"2027-04-12","endDate":"2027-04-15"}

### 5. Моя история
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Статистика гостиницы (ADMIN token)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/hotels/1/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Отмена: подставьте UUID брони из ответа на шаге 4
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/REPLACE_WITH_BOOKING_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
